Would you like me to:
- Draft a short email to Amy listing these questions and asking for a meeting?
- Produce a printable one-page checklist you can take to your appointment?
- Help prioritize your top 3 non-negotiables based on what you tell me are your main concerns (e.g., custody, housing, immigration status, financial support)?

If you want me to draft the email or checklist, tell me which items are your top priorities and whether children are involved.

