- Retirement account statements, pension statements, stock option docs
- Mortgage statements, property deeds, vehicle titles
- Credit card statements, loan docs, business financials
- Insurance policies (health, life, auto), beneficiary designations
- Childcare, school, medical bills for children
- Communications evidencing relationship bona fides (photos, messages, joint bills, leases, joint accounts)
- Any incidents or records of abuse (police reports, medical reports, restraining orders)
- Evidence related to change in status (emails from USCIS/attorney, appointment notices)

3) Suggested specific question phrases to use with Amy
