- “If we reach a settlement, how should the marital settlement agreement be drafted so it doesn’t harm my immigration case?”
- “Can you explain how California community property rules apply to our assets and what documentation you need to prove separate property?”
- “What temporary orders should I request before settlement talks to protect my finances and safety?”
- “If I need an immigration waiver or a special filing because of divorce, can you coordinate with an immigration attorney? Do you have recommendations?”

4) Settlement terms to consider requesting/including
