- How will community property laws apply to our assets and debts? Which assets are likely community vs. separate?
- What valuation methods will we use for the house, retirement accounts, business interests, and foreign assets?
- How do we handle division of retirement accounts and tax consequences (QDROs, capital gains, future tax liability)?

Support (spousal and child)
- How is spousal support calculated here? What factors will the court consider (length of marriage, standard of living, age/health, earning capacity)?
- What are likely durations for spousal support in my situation?
- How is child support calculated and what temporary child support should we request while proceedings are pending?
- How will health insurance and childcare expenses be addressed in a settlement?

