- Should any language be included or avoided in the settlement (e.g., admissions, releases) to protect my immigration case?
- If there’s removal/immigration court involvement, should we wait to finalize certain terms until my immigration status is stable?

Legal protections & contingency planning
- Should we seek temporary restraining orders, no-contact provisions, or other protective provisions in the settlement?
- What enforcement mechanisms should the settlement include if the ex violates terms (attorney-fee shifting, penalties, liens, contempt)?
- If the ex later challenges the settlement based on fraud/non-disclosure, how can we guard against that (full financial disclosure language, releases)?

