- Save that as a draft to send to Amy?
- Send it now to Amy Foster (Caldwell Legal) — if so, provide her email address or confirm you want me to find it?
- Convert the list into a printable checklist or a shorter version for the hearing?

If you want, I can also make a prioritized one-page checklist specifically for your hearing next month (what to do this week, next week, and the day before). Which would you prefer?

