Top questions to ask Amy (priority order)
- Immigration coordination
  - How will my changed immigration status affect the divorce process and any pending immigration case in immigration court?
  - Do we need an immigration specialist to review any settlement terms before I sign?
  - Is there any language or admissions I should avoid in settlement talks or court filings that could harm my immigration case?
  - Will finalizing a divorce now affect any current or future immigration relief I may seek (e.g., adjustment, VAWA, cancellation, or derivative benefits)?
- Immediate protections & short-term orders
  - Do we need temporary orders now (child custody, spousal/child support, exclusive use of the home, restraining order, asset freeze)?
  - If urgent, can you file an ex parte/temporary order before the hearing?
- Financial division & preservation
  - What documents do you need for full financial disclosure and valuation (bank accounts, retirement, property, debts, business records)?
  - How are community vs separate assets handled here (California community property rules) and what can I do to preserve separate property?
